  "findings": [
    "For this fixed RGB/name profile ODA writes group 62 = 254 even if all 13 EED group-1070 values are changed to 1 or 0, the input group 62 is explicitly 1, or DBColXD is renamed throughout. The EED 254 coincidence therefore does not establish a mapping; do not synthesize group 62 from that EED item.",
    "The five DBColXD cases each lost one of the 13 input tuples in ODA output; the renamed-tag case retained 13. No assertion is made about why ODA changes this opaque application data or whether it is semantically redundant. Preserve original EED instead of copying ODA output.",
    "ODA normalized the conflicting explicit group 62 = 1 to 254 for this fixed color. The experiment does not establish the general algorithm, whether the ACI is computed from RGB, or the effect in an independent native color-book consumer."
  ],
